# The init script in src/test/resources/db/init is copied into the Postgres container and executed
# by psql inside Linux. Committing it with CRLF from a Windows checkout is the kind of thing that
# only breaks in CI, so pin line endings for everything that crosses into a container.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
